SEC. 51P-229.107. USES.

The only uses permitted on the Property are as follows:

(1) multiple-family;

(2) hotel or motel;

(3) those professional, personal service, and custom crafts uses that are permitted in an O-2 Office District (“office uses”);

(4) those retail uses that are permitted in an SC Shopping Center District (“retail uses”); and

(5) the following bar and restaurant uses (“restaurant uses”):

(i) restaurant without drive-in service; and

(ii) restaurant with alcoholic beverages and/or entertainment. (Ord. Nos. 24122; 25711)
